  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "Seⁿ-thòaⁿ Bó-gí Thoân Āu-tāi"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<h1 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\"><b>生湠母語傳後代</b></span></h1><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>Tân Têng-iông</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lia̍t-ūi chu-kun góa chóng chhiáⁿ,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">sèⁿ Tân Têng-iông góa ê miâ,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">gún lâi siá koa hō͘ lín thiaⁿ,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">bó-gí chhòng-chok chin chhia-iāⁿ.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ji̍t-pún si̍t-si Hông-bîn-hòa,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kok-bîn-chèng-hú m̄ goān soah,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">jîn-bîn ná bah chāi-lâng koah,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">kìm-chí bó-gí siū thoa-bôa.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Siăn-pái piàⁿ-sè hō͘ bó-gí,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">tháu-pàng le̍k-sú thó chèng-gī,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">bó-gí ì-sek chiām kak-chhíⁿ,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">chhui-sak bó-gí tng tio̍h-sî.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Bó-gí chu-sán chin pó-kùi,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">sio̍k-gí kù kù chhàng tì-hūi,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">sì-kù-liân-á tián chhùi-súi,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">lâm-lú po-koa sim-hoe-khui.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Thoân-sêng bûn-hòa iōng bó-gí,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">tah-óa seng-oa̍h siōng tio̍h-bī,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">jīn-bat ka-tī ê té-tì,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">kiōng-tông chhòng-chō sin sè-kí.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kóa-á kàu chia beh chhé-pái,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">tâng-chê chò-hóe kho͘-óa--lâi,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">hun-phài khang-khòe tàu an-pâi,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">seⁿ-thòaⁿ bó-gí thoân āu-tāi.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><!--more--><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhbEAPYR89pJPA4UHG8rsL1-MGyk3wOhdFevhX4HY9ZYgBLNDqSe4DhrnsCXuJxe95-Gljw-R9KKVEJmulRpdRwR227EkdmANahCUwR9pYIouKD1DHW4ZqoOCjuWRmnuMa4papCUqG4jozGInUZYoXcxW5IvZ9lV7Woiz4vu75W7jbW4liHes5-jfRf6IOF/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1363%E6%9C%9F_47.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogg